    "postalCode": {
      "label": "KYN-NNNN",
      "required": true,
      "usage": "Use an integral KY, island digit 1/2/3, hyphen and four-digit section or unique-organization value only with a current Cayman Islands Postal Service assignment. Mail is delivered through private letter boxes at post offices; an ordinary street-only address is undeliverable. Use the official island name Grand Cayman, Cayman Brac or Little Cayman on the postcode line. UPU examples KY1-1100, KY1-1103 and KY1-1600 are examples, not a current complete denominator. Company unique postcodes are non-area unless competent-authority geometry says otherwise. Do not turn islands, offices, box ranges, Street Address polygons, parcels, administrative boundaries, Points, buffers, hulls, cells or models into postal areas. Derived or virtual geometry requires an explicit competent-authority postcode crosswalk, compatible rights, edition, CRS, topology, method, confidence and exceptions. Building display requires a separately rights-cleared civic-address identity, building identity and explicit relation. AGID remains an independent spatial index."
    }
